{"id":"torrey:bottles","source":"torrey","name":"Bottles","slug":"bottles","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"First mention of, in Scripture — Ge 21:14.","refs":[["Gen",21,14,21,14]]},{"text":"Ancients often drank from — Hab 2:15.","refs":[["Hab",2,15,2,15]]},{"text":"Water. — Ge 21:14,15,19.","refs":[["Gen",21,14,21,14],["Gen",21,15,21,15],["Gen",21,19,21,19]]},{"text":"Milk. — Jdj 4:19.","refs":[["Judg",4,19,4,19]]},{"text":"Wine. — 1Sa 1:24; 16:20.","refs":[["1Sam",1,24,1,24],["1Sam",16,20,16,20]]},{"text":"Some, made of earthenware — Jer 19:1.","refs":[["Jer",19,1,19,1]]},{"text":"Shrivelled and dried by smoke. — Ps 119:83.","refs":[["Ps",119,83,119,83]]},{"text":"Marred by age and use. — Jos 9:14,13.","refs":[["Josh",9,14,9,14],["Josh",9,13,9,13]]},{"text":"When old, unfit for holding new wine. — Mt 9:17; Mr 2:22.","refs":[["Matt",9,17,9,17],["Mark",2,22,2,22]]},{"text":"Sometimes probably of large dimensions. — 1Sa 25:18; 2Sa 16:1.","refs":[["1Sam",25,18,25,18],["2Sam",16,1,16,1]]},{"text":"Of the clouds. — Job 38:37.","refs":[["Job",38,37,38,37]]},{"text":"Of God’s remembrance. — Ps 56:8.","refs":[["Ps",56,8,56,8]]},{"text":"Of sinners ripe for judgment. — Jer 13:12-14.","refs":[["Jer",13,12,13,14]]},{"text":"(Dried up,) of the afflicted. — Ps 119:83.","refs":[["Ps",119,83,119,83]]},{"text":"(Ready to burst,) of the impatient. — Job 32:19.","refs":[["Job",32,19,32,19]]},{"text":"(Broken,) of severe judgments. — Isa 30:14; Jer 19:10; 48:12.","refs":[["Isa",30,14,30,14],["Jer",19,10,19,10],["Jer",48,12,48,12]]}],"refCount":24}
